         <Description>Operational Level 1A image data from the Compact Coronagraph-2 (CCOR-2) aboard the SOLAR-1 spacecraft. The data consist of processed white-light coronagraph images of the solar corona. The images have dimensions of 2048 by 1920 pixels and are provided in FITS format in units of mean solar brightness (MSB). Level 1A products are generated from Level 0B data at an approximately 15-minute cadence for near-real-time space weather operations.</Description>
